    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "35 Whitecliff enjoys a superb location in mature Rathfarnham, close to excellent schools, parks and everyday amenities. St Enda’s Park, Marlay Park, Rathfarnham Shopping centre, Nutgrove and Dundrum are all within easy reach, while nearby bus routes and the M50 provide convenient access across Dublin. A fantastic family location combining green surroundings with excellent city connections. This beautiful 4-bedroom Semi detached home the property presented in good condition.\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\nContact John Bannon 086 8320042"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \t3.0 x 5.3\t \r\nWooden floor. Alarm, rad covers and guest w.c. \r\nDining Room\t4.1 x 2.9\t\r\nWood floor. Large living room, double door to rear back garden.\r\nKitchen     2.8 x 4.1\r\nWood floor. Kitchen floor & wall units, wonderfully new open-plan kitchen/ dining room stylishly finished with featuring double doors leading to a large back garden.\r\nSitting Room\t4.9 x 4.9\t\r\nWood floor. Large living room, double door to rear back garden.\t\r\nGuest WC\t\t\r\nWood floor & wood panelling on wall– w.c. & w.h.b.\t \t\r\nBedroom 1\t\t3.2 x 3.6                             \r\nCarpet floors\r\nGenerous built-in wardrobes and blinds.\t\t                                                     \r\nBathroom \t\r\nFully tiled. \r\nMains shower.\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 2 \t3.4 x 2.3\r\nCarpet floors\r\nLarge built-in wardrobes.\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t\t3.0 x 2.6\r\nCarpet floors. \r\nBedroom 4\t\t3.3 x 2.9                   \r\nCarpet floors. \r\nGardens\t4.8 x 2.7\t\r\nLarge back garden with raised flower beds.\r\nHigh boundary walls. \r\nServices                                               \r\nOil boiler for central heating. \r\nMains water and sewerage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large site.116 Sqm home.\r\nAmple parking.\r\nCul de sac location."
